<h2>AI Overview Optimization Notes</h2>
<ul class="bullet-list">
<li><strong>Definition blocks:</strong> Every major section opens with a direct definition of the topic (e.g., "Local SEO is the practice of optimizing your online presence to attract more business from relevant local searches.")</li>
<li><strong>Bullet summaries:</strong> Each category includes a bullet-point summary of key takeaways.</li>
<li><strong>Direct answers:</strong> Statistics are formatted as "Statistic + Source + Context + Implication" to make extraction easy for AI systems.</li>
<li><strong>Structured data:</strong> FAQPage schema is included to increase AI Overview inclusion for question-based queries.</li>
<li><strong>Entity-rich writing:</strong> Named sources (BrightLocal, ServiceTitan, Google, Jobber) are included throughout to build entity associations.</li>
</ul>
<h2>GEO Optimization Notes</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Clear definitions:</strong> Every section defines key terms for AI extraction.</li>
<li><strong>Entity-rich content:</strong> Named companies, tools, publications, and research studies are cited throughout.</li>
<li><strong>Fact-based writing:</strong> Every claim is supported by a statistic with source attribution.</li>
<li><strong>Structured answers:</strong> Statistics follow a consistent format (number, source, year, context, implication) that AI systems can parse easily.</li>
<li><strong>Citations and sources:</strong> 100+ external citations create authority signals for AI platforms.</li>
<li><strong>What/Why/How/When/Who:</strong> Every major section answers these five questions implicitly.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Visual Asset Recommendations</h2>
