</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2>Quality Control Sign-Off</h2>
<ul class="checklist">
<li>[x] 100 verified statistics included</li>
<li>[x] Every statistic has a source (publication + year)</li>
<li>[x] 2025 data prioritized; older data noted with context</li>
<li>[x] Statistics organized into 7 categories per brief</li>
<li>[x] Each stat includes Context (why it matters) and Implication (what to do)</li>
<li>[x] 4,000+ word count target met</li>
<li>[x] 10 title options generated with CTR magnet method</li>
<li>[x] Meta title (50–60 characters) and meta description (140–160 characters) optimized</li>
<li>[x] URL slug optimized</li>
<li>[x] FAQ section with 10 questions included</li>
<li>[x] Internal linking suggestions provided</li>
<li>[x] External citation suggestions provided</li>
<li>[x] Schema markup recommendations included</li>
<li>[x] Featured snippet opportunities identified</li>
<li>[x] AI Overview optimization applied</li>
<li>[x] GEO optimization applied</li>
<li>[x] EEAT signals demonstrated (expertise, experience, authority, trustworthiness)</li>
<li>[x] Zero AI filler words ("delve," "crucial," "landscape")</li>
<li>[x] Zero generic intros</li>
<li>[x] Short paragraphs (2–4 sentences)</li>
<li>[x] Active voice dominates</li>
<li>[x] Specific numbers and sources throughout</li>
<li>[x] Content is publication-ready</li>
</ul>`;
